Scope
-----
This license covers the files in this directory and its subdirectories:
the animated rig files (*.glb), the prompt catalog (prompts.json), and
the compilation and presentation of these assets. It does not cover the
paper (unimate.pdf), which is governed by its own publication terms.

The animation and rigging data in these files were generated by UniMate
as demonstration output for the project page at
https://linzhanmou.com/unimate/.

